OL,3,GNEWSATown traders plead for help over
OL,4,Ateen trouble-makers
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusiness owners in part of
OL,7,FNottinghamshire have called for more
OL,8,Faction from police over gangs of
OL,9,Fteenagers engaging in nuisance
OL,10,Fbehaviour.
OL,12,FA 12-hour dispersal order was put in
OL,13,Fplace for Beeston town centre on
OL,14,FTuesday following reports of violence,
OL,15,Fpublic order offences and robbery.
OL,17,FNeil Walton, who runs gift and
OL,18,Fjewellery shop Iguazu Fair Trade, said
OL,19,Fhe was assaulted when a group climbed
OL,20,Fon to his roof and officers then
OL,21,Frefused to arrest anyone after taking
OL,22,F40 minutes to arrive.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
